{"version":1,"content":"<p>旅發局公布，9月初步訪港旅客人次錄得約403萬，較去年同期增加22%。</p><p>今年首九個月累計訪港旅客約4070萬人次，按年增加12%。</p><p>旅發局認為反映香港旅遊業持續保持增長動力。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.995611+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:42:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:45.039825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"61008236556cbaa29f6a52f26799262b5bfc27cbdc1b1bf31b036311a94f8056","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}